# Allowlist: the remote only holds what is needed to read the project on GitHub
# (README + executed notebooks + README figures). Everything else - source package,
# tests, environment files, data, generated artefacts - stays local.

# 1. ignore everything at the top level
/*

# 2. re-include the minimum
!/.gitignore
!/README.md

!/notebooks/
/notebooks/*
!/notebooks/*.ipynb

!/docs/
/docs/*
!/docs/images/
/docs/images/*
!/docs/images/*.png

# 3. never commit notebook checkpoints, even inside allowed folders
.ipynb_checkpoints/
